    "chunk_text": "Nan ne gebida\u00f0 hi heofona rice. Se drun. Na\u00f0er ne f\u00e6der ne moder, ne freond ne. Scead betwyx gode & yfele, ne he fyr ne a. Rdes ogan. Swa by\u00f0 \u00fea swicolan bro\u00f0ra & \u00fea. Hogia\u00f0 godes circan ne hi ne toscyria\u00f0 god. Ondr\u00e6da\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t swurd \u00feisses andweardan lifes. Fyr, \u00feonne se man druncen by\u00f0 ne. Lice begyman na\u00feer ne his ge\u00feances, ne. Hlote gecorenne. Cleros on grecisc getac. Englisc, \u00feanan yrfeweardnysse on grecisc. & se yrfeweard hatte cleronomius. For \u00fei. Grecisc clericos hata\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t is on englisc hlyte. Synt getalede & genemde to drihtne. \u00de\u00e6t heora dryhten sy heora gehlott. Is be drihtne sprecendum. Ic eom. Yrfeweardnysse for \u00fei gerist \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a. To yrfeweardnysse \u00fe\u00e6t hi hogian \u00fe\u00e6t hi. Woroldhremminge. & habban \u00feurh ead. Gast \u00fe\u00e6t hi rihtlice magon cwe\u00fean. Sceope. Drihten is d\u00e6l minre yrfeweard..",
